<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Ahmsa Q1 net halved.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Ahmsa Q1 net halved.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican steel company Altos Hornos de Mexico (Ahmsa) said on Tuesday its net income was 754 million pesos in the first quarter of 1997, compared with 1.541 billion pesos for the first three months of 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The results were impacted by a 12 percent decrease in the average price of steel in the international markets between the first quarter of 1997 and the first quarter of 1996,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
